  "instructions": [
    "In a pressure cooker, combine adobo sauce, butter, sugar, lemon juice, vanilla extract, garlic, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.",
    "Add frozen mixed berries and close the pressure cooker lid.",
    "Cook on high pressure for 5 minutes, then quick-release the pressure.",
    "In a small pan, heat coconut oil over medium heat and toast sesame seeds until lightly browned.",
    "Sprinkle toasted sesame seeds over the cooked mixed berries and serve hot or chilled, garnished with lime zest.",
    "Grill the dish on a binchotan grill for a few minutes to add a smoky flavor, if desired."
